WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.825
On the ServiceNow side, a Scripted
REST script receives every post.

2
00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:08.641
It validates the payload, sets
the priority and the due date,

3
00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.288
and de-duplicates against open findings.

4
00:00:11.288 --> 00:00:15.340
When the payload carries no
intended state, it derives one:

5
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.225
a native change is reverted,
an attribute change is kept.

6
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:21.630
And on a successful provisioning signal,

7
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.813
it moves matching findings
to Awaiting verification.

8
00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:28.712
The guide's Gate 4 validation
lists what the kit already checks.

9
00:00:28.712 --> 00:00:33.561
The contract test checks the workflow
file's shape, that it holds no secrets,

10
00:00:33.561 --> 00:00:37.237
and that every field its bodies
send is read by the script.

11
00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.294
The Node tests check
priority and due date,

12
00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:43.700
de-duplication, and that
a bad payload gets a 400.

13
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.117
But none of it showed the payload itself,

14
00:00:46.117 --> 00:00:50.570
because SailPoint resolves the body's
dollar keys at run time, in a tenant.
